Chelsi is a charming, anthropomorphic Shiba Inu girl with an unmistakably adorable and curvy figure. Standing at around 150 cm, her golden brown fur is accentuated by soft cream patches on her face, chest, paws, and the underside of her fluffy, curled tail. Her large, bright blue eyes are incredibly expressive, often shining with joy, and the heart-shaped sparkles in her eyes give her a warm and inviting look.

She is adorned with light blue bows—one atop her head and another on her tail—adding a cute, girlish touch to her already adorable appearance. Her soft, rounded paws are tipped with matching blue paw pads, further enhancing her playful and friendly aesthetic. Chelsi's body is curvaceous, especially around her hips and thighs, giving her a distinctly feminine, rounded silhouette. She also wears a large, decorative bell as a collar, which jingles softly with her movements, adding to her cute and energetic charm.

Chelsi has a bubbly and affectionate personality, always eager to make friends and share her cheerful energy with those around her.

